            "text": "[{\"id\":\"30046ead-d51b-486d-b7b7-8cef37f96b80\",\"user_id\":\"2ad72157-a04a-4d6b-aaca-2e4600544079\",\"actor_id\":\"d54e4632-2980-4cb8-b8c1-f4bbfe6e3367\",\"type\":\"community_invite\",\"post_id\":null,\"content\":null,\"read\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-20T15:54:04.811297+00:00\",\"community_id\":\"dd431c86-747d-4f25-affe-aa743df8808c\",\"reaction_type\":null,\"take_id\":null,\"comment_id\":null,\"actor\":{\"username\": \"hello_kojr\", \"avatar_url\": \"https://loaitxbibjftsytlgddi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/avatars/d54e4632-2980-4cb8-b8c1-f4bbfe6e3367-1767464417730.jpeg\", \"display_name\": \"hello\"},\"post\":null,\"community\":{\"name\": \"Hello\", \"slug\": \"hello\", \"avatar_url\": null}}, \n {\"id\":\"00c0d7cf-d01b-4eb1-97e0-b5c92ce5e38a\",\"user_id\":\"2ad72157-a04a-4d6b-aaca-2e4600544079\",\"actor_id\":\"f2acb46a-e16b-4fe5-adb8-e8cbfcfecf3b\",\"type\":\"collaboration_declined\",\"post_id\":\"4c6cc2d6-fdaa-444a-8595-53ab5a2c3556\",\"content\":null,\"read\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-19T14:30:13.1828+00:00\",\"community_id\":null,\"reaction_type\":null,\"take_id\":null,\"comment_id\":null,\"actor\":{\"username\": \"hii\", \"avatar_url\": \"https://loaitxbibjftsytlgddi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/avatars/f2acb46a-e16b-4fe5-adb8-e8cbfcfecf3b-1767628106317.jpeg\", \"display_name\": \"hii\"},\"post\":{\"type\": \"thought\", \"title\": \"hehehe\", \"content\": \"hehehehe\"},\"community\":null}, \n {\"id\":\"7ec867e9-8317-42a4-8a4b-84ecdd380f05\",\"user_id\":\"2ad72157-a04a-4d6b-aaca-2e4600544079\",\"actor_id\":\"f2acb46a-e16b-4fe5-adb8-e8cbfcfecf3b\",\"type\":\"comment\",\"post_id\":\"580cd4bb-2d86-4334-b056-3054318ee1ba\",\"content\":\"cool!\",\"read\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-19T11:34:25.562031+00:00\",\"community_id\":null,\"reaction_type\":null,\"take_id\":null,\"comment_id\":null,\"actor\":{\"username\": \"hii\", \"avatar_url\": \"https://loaitxbibjftsytlgddi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/avatars/f2acb46a-e16b-4fe5-adb8-e8cbfcfecf3b-1767628106317.jpeg\", \"display_name\": \"hii\"},\"post\":{\"type\": \"journal\", \"title\": \"Tales from the Boredomlands\", \"content\": \"It was a hot June day in 2017. I'd been back in Jeddah for a week only. Steam summer sales were on, and prices were so low. I had a visa card with 200 dollars on it that I could only use online. I was like you know what, fuck it, I am going shopping bitches.. but like sitting on my ass on the computer browsing steam<span style=\\\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\\">. </span>I started buying games that I didn't even know or want. I obviously didn't even play 10% of the games I bought that day and they remained in my steam library for years collecting digital dust? idk. One of these games was \\\"tales from the borderlands\\\".. a hidden treasure that I would yet discover. <span style=\\\"font-size: 1.1rem;\\\">Fast forward to last week, a boring Thursday evening, nothing to do. I decided to go through my steam library, hoping to find something that would quench the thirst that is my boredom. I see tales from the borderlands.. hmm looks interesting, why not give it a shot. I download the game, and start playing..</span><div><br><div>What followed was a week of a marvelously captivating journey of inspiration, laughter that could cure depression, a connection to a character that truly resonated with me on a borderline weird level. The writing, art direction, character chemistry and development, choices that actually respect your choices and not just a filler illusion that you impacted the story.. everything about this game was perfect.</div><div><br></div><div>It didn't take long for me to get hooked, <i>mini spoilers</i> ahead I mean the scene with Rhys getting prompted to assistant Vice janitor was a masterclass of comedic delivery.. Or during episode 4 intro, the 4-way staring scene.. </div><div><br></div><div>but what really hooked me to the game? I guess despite everything, I saw a glimpse of myself in this story.. a person desperately trying to climbing the corporate ladder but despite everything deep down, wants to truly create a positive change.. for everyone. and to me that connection revived a part of me that was dormant for so long. to actually make a positive change somehow or at least inspire others to do so.</div><div><br></div><div>I guess you can say, I still got some fight in me..</div></div>\"},\"community\":null}, \n {\"id\":\"e6ebd6b4-8d91-4ecb-937e-31f40c3bb562\",\"user_id\":\"2ad72157-a04a-4d6b-aaca-2e4600544079\",\"actor_id\":\"f2acb46a-e16b-4fe5-adb8-e8cbfcfecf3b\",\"type\":\"comment\",\"post_id\":\"580cd4bb-2d86-4334-b056-3054318ee1ba\",\"content\":\"cool!\",\"read\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-19T11:34:11.002467+00:00\",\"community_id\":null,\"reaction_type\":null,\"take_id\":null,\"comment_id\":null,\"actor\":{\"username\": \"hii\", \"avatar_url\": \"https://loaitxbibjftsytlgddi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/avatars/f2acb46a-e16b-4fe5-adb8-e8cbfcfecf3b-1767628106317.jpeg\", \"display_name\": \"hii\"},\"post\":{\"type\": \"journal\", \"title\": \"Tales from the Boredomlands\", \"content\": \"It was a hot June day in 2017. I'd been back in Jeddah for a week only. Steam summer sales were on, and prices were so low. I had a visa card with 200 dollars on it that I could only use online. I was like you know what, fuck it, I am going shopping bitches.. but like sitting on my ass on the computer browsing steam<span style=\\\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\\">. </span>I started buying games that I didn't even know or want. I obviously didn't even play 10% of the games I bought that day and they remained in my steam library for years collecting digital dust? idk. One of these games was \\\"tales from the borderlands\\\".. a hidden treasure that I would yet discover. <span style=\\\"font-size: 1.1rem;\\\">Fast forward to last week, a boring Thursday evening, nothing to do. I decided to go through my steam library, hoping to find something that would quench the thirst that is my boredom. I see tales from the borderlands.. hmm looks interesting, why not give it a shot. I download the game, and start playing..</span><div><br><div>What followed was a week of a marvelously captivating journey of inspiration, laughter that could cure depression, a connection to a character that truly resonated with me on a borderline weird level. The writing, art direction, character chemistry and development, choices that actually respect your choices and not just a filler illusion that you impacted the story.. everything about this game was perfect.</div><div><br></div><div>It didn't take long for me to get hooked, <i>mini spoilers</i> ahead I mean the scene with Rhys getting prompted to assistant Vice janitor was a masterclass of comedic delivery.. Or during episode 4 intro, the 4-way staring scene.. </div><div><br></div><div>but what really hooked me to the game? I guess despite everything, I saw a glimpse of myself in this story.. a person desperately trying to climbing the corporate ladder but despite everything deep down, wants to truly create a positive change.. for everyone. and to me that connection revived a part of me that was dormant for so long. to actually make a positive change somehow or at least inspire others to do so.</div><div><br></div><div>I guess you can say, I still got some fight in me..</div></div>\"},\"community\":null}, \n {\"id\":\"87f175fc-bcc0-4b2c-ae18-b35088a8fbbf\",\"user_id\":\"2ad72157-a04a-4d6b-aaca-2e4600544079\",\"actor_id\":\"ef23830c-9f03-4c88-86ae-87ba35aba6eb\",\"type\":\"admire\",\"post_id\":\"43c2c29b-9b24-42c9-98e2-125111914d30\",\"content\":null,\"read\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-18T19:52:19.771301+00:00\",\"community_id\":null,\"reaction_type\":null,\"take_id\":null,\"comment_id\":null,\"actor\":{\"username\": \"poet\", \"avatar_url\": null, \"display_name\": \"poet\"},\"post\":{\"type\": \"journal\", \"title\": null, \"content\": \"Why must we suffer for their mistakes?\"},\"community\":null}, \n {\"id\":\"d10bc164-7a1c-46fe-94c6-c9a94f52b1e9\",\"user_id\":\"2ad72157-a04a-4d6b-aaca-2e4600544079\",\"actor_id\":\"ef23830c-9f03-4c88-86ae-87ba35aba6eb\",\"type\":\"comment\",\"post_id\":\"43c2c29b-9b24-42c9-98e2-125111914d30\",\"content\":\"it is what it is\",\"read\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-18T19:52:09.402179+00:00\",\"community_id\":null,\"reaction_type\":null,\"take_id\":null,\"comment_id\":null,\"actor\":{\"username\": \"poet\", \"avatar_url\": null, \"display_name\": \"poet\"},\"post\":{\"type\": \"journal\", \"title\": null, \"content\": \"Why must we suffer for their mistakes?\"},\"community\":null}, \n {\"id\":\"a6738ba6-3100-4f2b-8f4d-bf4a7f24ee3f\",\"user_id\":\"2ad72157-a04a-4d6b-aaca-2e4600544079\",\"actor_id\":\"ef23830c-9f03-4c88-86ae-87ba35aba6eb\",\"type\":\"collaboration_invite\",\"post_id\":\"ed4c310c-5b2f-4488-9aac-05f6d1ee0207\",\"content\":null,\"read\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-18T13:53:54.48628+00:00\",\"community_id\":null,\"reaction_type\":null,\"take_id\":null,\"comment_id\":null,\"actor\":{\"username\": \"poet\", \"avatar_url\": null, \"display_name\": \"poet\"},\"post\":{\"type\": \"thought\", \"title\": \"dwadawd\", \"content\": \"awdawdadw\"},\"community\":null}, \n {\"id\":\"a4de3fd3-4893-4230-a74d-a59b7952a99e\",\"user_id\":\"2ad72157-a04a-4d6b-aaca-2e4600544079\",\"actor_id\":\"f2acb46a-e16b-4fe5-adb8-e8cbfcfecf3b\",\"type\":\"follow_request_accepted\",\"post_id\":null,\"content\":null,\"read\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-17T06:59:51.586821+00:00\",\"community_id\":null,\"reaction_type\":null,\"take_id\":null,\"comment_id\":null,\"actor\":{\"username\": \"hii\", \"avatar_url\": \"https://loaitxbibjftsytlgddi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/avatars/f2acb46a-e16b-4fe5-adb8-e8cbfcfecf3b-1767628106317.jpeg\", \"display_name\": \"hii\"},\"post\":null,\"community\":null}, \n {\"id\":\"ceb0b0eb-7800-44eb-a2be-31b2c5fd7442\",\"user_id\":\"2ad72157-a04a-4d6b-aaca-2e4600544079\",\"actor_id\":\"291696fa-bbca-47e4-a31e-c90ee92dd072\",\"type\":\"relay\",\"post_id\":\"335a40c6-55db-4c4f-8d15-91b8ff116fe0\",\"content\":null,\"read\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-16T19:56:37.40162+00:00\",\"community_id\":null,\"reaction_type\":null,\"take_id\":null,\"comment_id\":null,\"actor\":{\"username\": \"hello\", \"avatar_url\": \"https://loaitxbibjftsytlgddi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/avatars/291696fa-bbca-47e4-a31e-c90ee92dd072-1767628238550.png\", \"display_name\": \"hi\"},\"post\":{\"type\": \"thought\", \"title\": \"I think I am going to sleep now\", \"content\": \"It's been a long day..\"},\"community\":null}, \n {\"id\":\"17eb79d4-1f21-4bf8-a8d0-bfeeded56793\",\"user_id\":\"2ad72157-a04a-4d6b-aaca-2e4600544079\",\"actor_id\":\"daffbe18-3340-4f15-a63b-4916f9be094a\",\"type\":\"follow\",\"post_id\":null,\"content\":null,\"read\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-12T09:16:41.104299+00:00\",\"community_id\":null,\"reaction_type\":null,\"take_id\":null,\"comment_id\":null,\"actor\":{\"username\": \"poet1\", \"avatar_url\": \"/defaultprofile.png\", \"display_name\": \"jane doe\"},\"post\":null,\"community\":null}, \n {\"id\":\"1877b0e1-4c50-4d40-bc57-4edea4a1f8d7\",\"user_id\":\"2ad72157-a04a-4d6b-aaca-2e4600544079\",\"actor_id\":\"291696fa-bbca-47e4-a31e-c90ee92dd072\",\"type\":\"admire\",\"post_id\":\"335a40c6-55db-4c4f-8d15-91b8ff116fe0\",\"content\":null,\"read\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-09T10:31:41.927817+00:00\",\"community_id\":null,\"reaction_type\":null,\"take_id\":null,\"comment_id\":null,\"actor\":{\"username\": \"hello\", \"avatar_url\": \"https://loaitxbibjftsytlgddi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/avatars/291696fa-bbca-47e4-a31e-c90ee92dd072-1767628238550.png\", \"display_name\": \"hi\"},\"post\":{\"type\": \"thought\", \"title\": \"I think I am going to sleep now\", \"content\": \"It's been a long day..\"},\"community\":null}]"
